Subject: [RFC PATCH 2/2] libtests/backtrace01: New test

Check that rtems_backtrace() returns an address in each of three nested
functions, in order, that it stops at the size of the array, and that
it stores nothing for a size of zero.  The test is built with
-funwind-tables, so the walk does not stop in it.

